sequenceDiagram
    participant FileSystem as File System
    participant FileWatcher as FileWatcher
    participant Buffer as Buffer (Rx)
    participant Router as BroadcastGroup Router
    participant S3Actor as S3 FileSyncActor Pool
    participant AzureActor as Azure FileSyncActor Pool
    participant S3Client as S3Client
    participant AzureClient as BlobClient
    participant S3Storage as AWS S3
    participant AzureStorage as Azure Blob Storage

    Note over FileSystem,AzureStorage: File Sync Process Flow

    FileSystem->>FileWatcher: File Event (Created/Changed/Deleted/Renamed)
    FileWatcher->>FileWatcher: Create FileNotificationMessage
    FileWatcher->>Buffer: OnNext(FileNotificationMessage)
    
    Note over Buffer: Buffer for 2 seconds or 10 files
    
    Buffer->>Router: Sync(List<FileNotificationMessage>)
    Note over Router: Groups by OldFullPath, takes latest by timestamp
    
    Router->>S3Actor: Tell(FileNotificationMessage)
    Router->>AzureActor: Tell(FileNotificationMessage)
    
    par S3 Sync
        S3Actor->>S3Actor: Receive message, become Busy
        S3Actor->>S3Client: UpdateFile(msg)
        
        alt Created/Changed
            S3Client->>S3Storage: UploadFile(fullPath)
        else Deleted
            S3Client->>S3Storage: RemoveFile(fullPath)
        else Renamed
            S3Client->>S3Storage: RenameFile(oldPath, newPath)
        end
        
        S3Storage-->>S3Client: Response
        S3Client-->>S3Actor: Task Result
        S3Actor->>S3Actor: Handle SyncMessage, become Ready
        S3Actor->>S3Actor: Unstash queued messages
        
    and Azure Sync
        AzureActor->>AzureActor: Receive message, become Busy
        AzureActor->>AzureClient: UpdateFile(msg)
        
        alt Created/Changed
            AzureClient->>AzureStorage: UploadFile(fullPath)
        else Deleted
            AzureClient->>AzureStorage: RemoveFile(fullPath)
        else Renamed
            AzureClient->>AzureStorage: RenameFile(oldPath, newPath)
        end
        
        AzureStorage-->>AzureClient: Response
        AzureClient-->>AzureActor: Task Result
        AzureActor->>AzureActor: Handle SyncMessage, become Ready
        AzureActor->>AzureActor: Unstash queued messages
    end

    Note over S3Actor,AzureActor: Actors use Round Robin Pool (3 instances each)<br/>with auto-scaling (1-10 instances)
